<title>USA: LaSalle Home Mortgage completes purchase.</title>
<headline>LaSalle Home Mortgage completes purchase.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>LaSalle Home Mortgage Corp, a unit of ABN-AMRO Holding NV, said Tuesday it has completed its acquisition of Minneapolis-based retail mortgage banking operation  Heigl Mortgage and Financial Corp.</p>
<p>Mark Heigl will remain as president of Heigl, which will keep its name and operate as a wholly owned subsidiary of LaSalle, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
